        '教学建议' +
      '</h4>' +
      '<div class="space-y-3 text-slate-600">' +
        '<div class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span><p>加强对 ' + weakClass.className + ' 的帮扶力度，建立"一对一"或小组互助机制，缩小班级间差距。</p></div>' +
        '<div class="flex gap-3 items-start"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shrink-0"></span><p>针对 ' + weakSubject.name + ' 科目组织备课组研讨，分析失分点，调整后续教学重点。</p></div>' +
